}

::ENG3_U06_L01_Q17::[MLA.ENG3.C.01] Context: A presentation has a clear focus but evidence from an unknown website with no author or date. What is the concern? {
=A. The evidence may not be credible.#Correct. Unknown authorship and date can weaken credibility. Notice how the answer uses the exact wording, evidence, or concept required by the standard.
